message: "If you refer to this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FigureMatch"
abstract: >-
  An AI content studio: a Next.js and FastAPI app that drafts marketing copy
  and matching images with OpenAI and keeps each user's work in Postgres,
  with its AWS deployment written in CDK. The bilingual Arabic/English
  figure checker its name refers to is not built.
